<title>NEW ZEALAND: Rugby Union - New Zealand beat Australia 30-13.</title>
<headline>Rugby Union - New Zealand beat Australia 30-13.</headline>
<dateline>CRISTCHURCH, New Zealand 1997-07-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New Zealand All Blacks beat the Australian Wallabies 30-13 (halftime 23-3) in their rugby union test match at Christchurch on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>New Zealand - Tries: Josh Kronfeld (2), Zinzan Brooke (2). Penalties: Carlos Spencer (2). Conversions: Spencer (2).</p>
<p>Australia - Try: Tim Horan. Penalties: John Eales (2). Conversion: Eales.</p>
